1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 exd4 4. Nxd4 Nxd4
5. Qxd4 { Retakes in the centre. The queen is well placed here and White is ahead in development. }
5... d6 ( 5... Qf6 6. Qxf6 Nxf6 7. Nc3 Bb4 8. Bd3 )
6. Bd3 { Develops, defends the e4 pawn and clears the way to castle. } 6... Nf6 7. O-O Be7 8. Nc3 O-O
9. Bg5 { Pins the knight on f6 to the queen on d8, so Black cannot move it freely. [%cal Gg5f6] } 9... Be6 *
